# INVWINHD.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: F1 in more of
# the screens and dialogs: the location tree (LOCS), the search dialog
# (SEARCH), the settings' first field (SETTINGS_DIR), the password
# dialog (PASSWD), the directory of a backup (ADMIN) and the item a new
# loan asks for, a dialog over the open loans without a section of its
# own (LOANS).
# ESC closes each help, then its dialog.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINHD.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B F1
S LOCS
K ESC ESC ALT-S T F1
S SEARCH
K ESC ESC ALT-O S F1
S SETTINGS
K ESC ESC ALT-O P F1
S PASSWD
K ESC ESC ALT-A B F1
S ADMIN
K ESC ESC ALT-I O INS F1
S LOANS
K ESC ESC ALT-F X
